- `b4e11c6c`: `fix(notifications): suppress task cancellation alerts when discarding draft batches`
- `605d837e`: `fix(projects): emit standard events on restore and clean up archive notes`
- `da59aa11`: `fix(web): suppress running duration on terminal workflow steps and remove redundant dashboard modal`
